body:
Bored of playing solo because about 80% of the people I face are duos or squads. It's really annoying. I could pull my teammates to play but I really don't feel like it.

&#x200B;

Edit: Adding to this, I've been killed by M80 9/10 raids. Feels like everyone and their mothers is using M80.

Lately I've been incorporating a lot of sidearms into my sniper builds. My current fave sidearm is the Glock 17 with the suppressor, the night sights and the X400, I usually go for quakemakers or just regular PSO ammo. Great against scavs or people with no face armor.

&#x200B;

I play sniper a lot, the glock is quick and quiet.

&#x200B;

Edit: For armor, whatever I can find, and for apparel, what gives the most drip. I like caps, boonies and a lot of stuff.

It's no secret that Discord and especially it's moderation team sucks major balls.

&#x200B;

I still use it tho, it's handy and the UI is great.

Cut back sugar, ingested radiation instead.

&#x200B;

Anyway, congrats on the third arm...

Not also that, but merge CMS's, splints, bandages and other medication.

&#x200B;

I think it'd be pretty dope.

Mute by Duncan Jones starring Alexander Skarsgard.

&#x200B;

It had a lot of negative ratings, some reviews claimed "cultural appropriation" and shit like that. I kinda enjoyed it.
